WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.733
Which is greater?

2
00:00:03.733 --> 00:00:10.467
Two sellers at the market have eggs. One has forty-two, the other twenty-four.

3
00:00:10.467 --> 00:00:15.600
First compare the tens: four tens are more than two tens.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:19.233
So forty-two is greater than twenty-four.

5
00:00:19.233 --> 00:00:23.233
The open side of the sign faces the bigger number.

6
00:00:23.233 --> 00:00:27.633
When the tens are equal, we compare the ones.
